OL,3,ATake That say 10th number one album
OL,4,Afeels as special as first
OL,5,
OL,6,FTake That have landed their 10th number
OL,7,Fone album, securing their spot as one
OL,8,Fof the most successful British bands in
OL,9,FOfficial Chart history.
OL,11,FThe Manchester group, made up of Gary
OL,12,FBarlow, Howard Donald and Mark Owen,
OL,13,Ftopped the UK album chart with
OL,14,FDreamers.
OL,16,FThe group first scored a number one
OL,17,Frecord more than three decades ago with
OL,18,Ftheir second studio album Everything
OL,19,FChanges.
